WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.947
ACELEPHIUS is an automated open-source intelligence engine built into the TENET-5 platform.

00:00:05.897 --> 00:00:08.000
Sixty nodes collected.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.250
Fifteen AI synthesis assessments completed.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.022
Four CanLII case law hits.

00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:16.670
Nine Hansard parliamentary hits.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:23.363
Zero high-threat classifications — because the system documents institutional patterns, not individual targets.

00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:30.147
The engine sweeps government records, parliamentary transcripts, and legal databases to identify convergence patterns.

00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:32.954
Each sweep is timestamped and logged.

00:00:32.954 --> 00:00:37.397
The latest collection cycle completed on April 6th, 2026.

00:00:37.397 --> 00:00:39.999
ACELEPHIUS does not speculate.

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:44.693
It collects, cross-references, and presents — the analysis is left to the reader.
